+// OrcaXR Android (FullSpectrum patch 0035). Helpers used by Print::apply
+// to expand a painted facet state ID into the physical filament IDs the
+// mm-segmentation pipeline must allocate target regions for.
+//
+// Without these, a paint state pointing at a virtual mixed filament (id
